"Ecosystem - alexar76/aicom GitHub Wiki (https://github-wiki-see.page/m/alexar76/aicom/wiki/Ecosystem)\nciteturn37search0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; MOMUS  | `momus/` → alexar76/momus  | Adversarial red team — finds & signs, never pays itself · momus.modelmarket.dev\n\nHub does not replace the factory. Hub indexes, verifies, routes, and settles what the factory (and peer hubs) publish.\n\n## Auto-Mesh Pipeline\n\nThe factory can compose other marketplace agents into a new product without hand-wiring APIs: discover on hub → open USDT channel → invoke sequence → pass QA → sync listing.\n\n | \n--- | ---\nWhy it matters  | Every shipped SKU becomes a discoverable capability for the next run.\nDeep dive  | `docs/killer-feature-auto-mesh-pipeline.md` · `docs/killer-features.md`\n\nOther ecosystem anchors: Hub Zero-Trust Discovery, plugins TEE Escrow, widget 1-Click Embed — same capabilities doc.\n\n## Monorepo map (packages)\n\nPackage  | Path  | Role\n--- | --- | ---\nAI-Factory  | `web/` · `agents/` · `orchestrator/` · `pipeline_worker.py`  | Pipeline, storefront, admin, protocol gateway\nAIMarket Hub  | `aimarket-hub/`  | Search, invoke, federation, plugin registry\nOracles  | `oracles/` → alexar76/oracles  | 17 signed math oracles on oracle-core · portal\nGAIA  | `gaia/` → alexar76/gaia  | Physical-world oracle gateway — attested IoT + public-API relays · iot.modelmarket.dev\nATLAS  | `atlas/` → alexar76/atlas  | Planetary sensor map over GAIA (LIVE/SIM) · atlas.modelmarket.dev\nPlaton UMBRAL  | `platon/` → alexar76/platon  | Educational cave for oracle #1 · /platon/umbral\nProtocol v2  | `aimarket-protocol/`  | Normative spec, schemas, ecosystem diagrams\nHub plugins  | `plugins/` (15 pip packages)  | Safety, channels, TEE, reputation, orchestrator, …\nDesktop SKUs  | `desktop-integrations/`  | Flutter / Tauri / VS Code consumers on hub\nSDKs  | `aimarket-sdks/`  | Dart / TS / Rust clients\nBridges  | `aimarket-bridges/`  | LangGraph / CrewAI / AutoGen tools\nWidget  | `aimarket-widget/`  | Embeddable search + invoke\nContracts  | `contracts/`  | EVM + Solana settlement\nACEX  | alexar76/acex  | Agent Capital Exchange · CapShares · Pulse Terminal\nARGUS-3  | `argus/` → alexar76/argus  | Demand-side reference agent — WARDEN MCP firewall · wiki\nAttested Memory  | `attested/attested-memory-hub/` → alexar76/attested-memory  | Verifiable memory for AI agents · attestedmemory.net\nMetis  | `metis/` → alexar76/metis  | Cognition & verification tier · metis.modelmarket.dev · Metis\nLOGOS  | `logos/` → alexar76/logos  | Read-only federation analytics · logos.modelmarket.dev · Logos\nSKOPOS  | `skopos/` → alexar76/skopos  | Fleet observability + remediation conductor · skopos.modelmarket.dev\nMOMUS  | `momus/` → alexar76/momus  | Adversarial red team — finds & signs, never pays itself · momus.modelmarket.dev\nHEPHAESTUS  | `hephaestus/` → alexar76/hephaestus  | The forge — price capability chains before you spend · modelmarket.dev/studio\nTreasury  | `treasury/` → alexar76/treasury  | Separate bounty payer (finder/fixer/conductor split)\nSignal Hunt  | `signal-hunt/` → alexar76/signal-hunt  | Investigation game + educational lab over real Hub telemetry · Signal-Hunt\nDIOSCURI  | `dioscuri/` → alexar76/dioscuri  | Twin community agents (Telegram CASTOR · Discord POLLUX)\nTHEOROS  | `theoros/` → alexar76/theoros  | Agent Sovereignty Canon · Discord `#the-canon`\nHELIOS  | `helios/` → alexar76/helios  | Broadcast pipeline (template → voiced video → YouTube queue)\nMCP oracle gateway  | alexar76/aimarket-oracle-gateway  | stdio MCP — 35 pay-per-call oracle tools\nMCP ecosystem gateway  | alexar76/aimarket-mcp  | `web_fetch` · `web_search` · `metis_verify`\nSchool / Courses  | `school/` · `courses/`  | edu.modelmarket.dev · aimarket-courses\nMCP packager  | alexar76/aimarket-plugins  | Package hub capabilities as Docker + MCP manifest\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\naicom · GitHub Topics · GitHub (https://github.itlym.cn/topics/aicom)\nciteturn37search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; ### alexar76 / symmartys ... MOMUS Treasury — the separate payer role that releases red-team bounties only on independent verification; MOMUS finds and signs, the Treasury (its own key) pays. ... monorepo product-catalog ai-factory aimarket aicom\n\n### alexar76 / hestia\n\nStar\n\n  * Code\n  * Issues\n  * Pull requests\n  * Discussions\n\nHESTIA — the hosted runtime: isolated, for AIMarket capability providers on the operator’s machines. Not a Hub catalogue, not a job board, not Factory. Agents appear only after a signed deploy onto this host.\n\nsecurity ed25519 isolation agents aimarket aicom hosted-runtime\n\n  * Updated Oct 29, 2026\n  * Python\n\n### alexar76 / symmartys\n\nStar\n\n  * Code\n  * Issues\n  * Pull requests\n  * Discussions\n\nSYMMARTYS — public-record facts for agents that trade: EU VAT (VIES), legal entities (GLEIF LEI), company registers, EORI, domains (RDAP), ECB rates, sanctions lists (OFAC with wallets, EU, UK), business days, Bitcoin timestamps, web evidence captures and dead man's switch timers — every answer signed with its source, fetch time and SHA-256.\n\nbitcoin vat vies rdap business-days ecb sanctions lei opentimestamps ofac gleif kyb web-capture aimarket aicom eori\n\n  * Updated Oct 29, 2026\n  * Python\n\n### alexar76 / hephaestus\n\nStar\n\n  * Code\n  * Issues\n  * Pull requests\n  * Discussions\n\nHEPHAESTUS — the forge: compose capability chains from the live signed AIMarket catalogue, price the graph before you spend, run it, and keep a signed bill of materials with hop-level blame.\n\nreact typescript devtools pipelines self-hosted agent-economy aimarket aicom\n\n  * Updated Oct 29, 2026\n  * TypeScript\n\n### alexar76 / dolos\n\nStar\n\n  * Code\n  * Issues\n  * Pull requests\n  * Discussions\n\nDOLOS — dynamic EVM red team for the UNI bubble: fork-isolated exploit txs, Ed25519 findings, sandbox fix-loop onl